{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"7127","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:7127","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:14154","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:14155","source":"egs"}],"music":[{"creditedName":"ZUN","creatorId":"egs:creator:2843","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:2843","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:2843","name":"ZUN","roleCode":"music","roleLabel":"作品音乐","identityStatus":"alias-only-review","relationId":"egs:work-creator:14157","source":"egs"}],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10478","characterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10478","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"蕾米莉亚·斯卡雷特","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场时为500岁的萝莉吸血鬼，红魔馆女主人，像贵族般注重威严和体面，性格跟外表一样非常孩子气而任性。害怕流动的水、阳光（会变蒸气，吸到蒸气的人会长生不死）、洋葱，但不怕十字架 (因为不知道有什么好怕)。曾经为了自己方便，将幻想乡笼罩在一片红雾之中（东方红魔乡）。似乎很爱喝咲夜泡的红茶（加B型血的红茶）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"吸血鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10478","value":"操纵命运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f690d22104f8f111475b1447410272bb87e8f7bccce675c2c305c56607c2853f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11010676fb7eab35e4a04aa8922af5f5f7a65a2e7771da6ad731f94b3003fe69.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10480","characterName":"恶魔之妹","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10480","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"10480","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"恶魔之妹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初登场时为495岁的吸血鬼，蕾米的妹妹，可是力量却比蕾米强很多。由于精神不稳定的关系一直被蕾米关在红魔馆未曾出去过，不知道人类就是她平常吃的点心。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10480"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10480","value":"吸血鬼"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10480","value":"破坏存在的事物程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/83/83964f3e3af22566a8ca21a95d195500ba42e6ab42946c8501fe92af1d3f5fa0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a98ff5cda8cad829040672041cbf2227e3ea9f22ff84f76db02decbdeaa60ef5.webp","width":200,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10483","characterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"10483","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"幽冥楼阁的亡灵少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"源远流长的西行寺家的大小姐，身为白玉楼的主人的亡灵公主。有脚的。一眼便能看出是什么都不会去想的轻浮的性格，但实际上因为已存在了一段相当长的日子，故此是有一定的知识，有时候会说出些仿佛在追寻着事物的原委般的说话，却往往是没有要点的。已成为了1000年以上的亡灵。不擅长对自己的能力没有效用的蓬莱人。是住在冥界的幽灵们的管理者。‘萃梦想’对战模式的对话中，被萃香指摘她对现世还有执念。“春雪异变”的元凶，让妖梦把“春度”收集起来，把名为“西行妖”的妖怪樱树的封印解封，使埋葬在树下的人复活。与八云紫是老朋友。生前为某“歌圣”的女儿。这个歌圣的名字没有被明确的记录下来，但在 ‘妖妖梦’中登场的和歌为“西行法师”的歌曲，再者幽幽子的姓是“西行寺”。西行寺家的古老文献中有写着“富士见之女孩”，在拥有“操纵死灵的的能力”之后便变成了“诱导别人死亡的能力”，因为厌恶简单地就能诱导人死亡的能力，与每当满开盛放时把许多人都吸引著，并成为了许多人的葬生之地，诱导别人死亡，最后化成了妖树“西行妖”的樱树。于是在“西行妖”满开之时，为了不再让“西行妖”的樱花满开，最后于树下自尽。成为亡灵后忘掉所有生前的记忆，也变得认为诱导别人死亡是一件蛮快乐的事。 (荣获第一届东方最萌冠军)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"在历史上西行法师是藤原秀郷的九代孙，是藤原四大家中北家后裔，而北家开祖是藤原不比等的第二子藤原房前。若把西行寺幽幽子与藤原妹红的父亲比拟为历史人物，她们两人就有远亲关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"亡灵"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10483","value":"操纵死亡程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e48a9da0c85b68dc9bff254c340a32988e7d433c926bf7aeb21dae10f5e26368.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b3203b696470b87edb27965ae16efb8069e69f6855d79327a84c3e8f6c3ef897.webp","width":126,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_10796","characterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"150819"},{"characterId":"10796","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"七色の人形使い \\ 七色的人偶使","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"爱丽丝·玛格特罗依德（Alice Margatroid，アリス·マーガトロイド）东方同人游戏系列中的一个角色，住在魔法森林的魔法使，总是拿着一本魔导书的少女。最早登场于《东方怪绮谈》，后来在《东方妖妖梦》中再次登场，获得了不错的人气。人物设定上旧五作和新作有较大区别，怪绮谈中设定爱丽丝是魔族（魔界人），但新作设定她“原本是人类，经过修行后就成为了称为「魔法使」的种族”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"魔法使"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操控人偶程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10796","value":"操纵魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/afbe91c817a0795a52ff7b9e241d9a5d519667ce8f7927672bd25dddff296112.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/813408c8cffd5267b40d160885859319fb88a8487926f1878d75702aca8a3f72.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_11563","characterName":"疯狂的月兔","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"11563","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"}]},"originalCharacterName":"疯狂的月兔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"铃仙·优昙华院·稻叶是只和其它妖兽气质大不相同的妖怪兔。她身体修长，步姿端正，不像妖兽。在妖兽之中算是活动缓慢。虽是妖兽，却从不袭击人类。相反会避开人类。有着很长耳朵和头发。总的来说，是只与众不同的妖怪兔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因幡帝是兔子们的领袖，而她则能对帝下命令（听说对方一直都不听话）。是真正的兔子们的领袖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"据说一直看着她的红眼会让人发狂，而且她的声音，要听也听不进去，相反在远处有时会听到在耳边说话。因为这么让人厌恶，几乎无法和她对话。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"平时住在永远亭，在那里行动不明。有时也会来村庄售药。带着一堆怪药出现在村庄是出了名的（例如一些很苦的药）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563","value":"月兔"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"11563","value":"操纵狂气的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd6a6a388595ad8a650b4f5a665a9d4aa7a498bcdba8e44a6295823fb4a01d4b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c9c29222305628105dacf9cda4e10d9fdda08f715307c559c3616976345bdab.webp","width":111,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_12688","characterName":"十六夜 咲夜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"12688","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"十六夜 咲夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是住在红魔馆并在里面工作的女仆。是被称之为恶魔之馆的红魔馆中唯一的人类，是女仆们的仆长。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是个在普通人类不敢接近的地方工作的不可思议的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"没人见过她在进入红魔馆之前是怎样的。而且她对幻想乡里人类的来访极为冷淡，常站在妖怪的阵营之中。所以人们觉得她不是幻想乡的人类，有可能是外面世界或者是别的世界来的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她没有和村落里任何人类亲近，身上含有许多谜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过，当她去村落买东西时，她会一脸愉快，一点也没有敌视人类的样子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12688","value":"操纵时间的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/badfc65679c51a64f83971b2fbcf3fd13d46dab33013f71db781edf64f76f640.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a45982af2e686a3ac26458362bc4b1715751ec4821b9bd2da5964412df51d2bd.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18972","characterName":"肉眼也無法捕捉的妖貓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18972","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"18972","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"18972","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"}]},"originalCharacterName":"肉眼也無法捕捉的妖貓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"貓股。也是八雲藍的式神，因此被稱為妖怪（八雲紫）的式神的式神（但沒和藍、紫住在一起）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根據『妖妖夢』附屬的角色設定.txt（キャラ設定.txt）記述，橙雖是讓鬼神依憑在妖怪貓身上的生物，但因為是身為式神的藍的術式，能力是頗低的，而且那個術式只要接觸到水就會立即解除，再者，因為身為貓的她對於水很懼怕，總括來說水就是她的弱點。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『文花帖（書籍）』中，雖然建立了貓之里（村）並在貓之里中鶴立雞群，但其他貓似乎都不太聽她的指揮。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『妖妖夢』第二關時與咲夜的對話中，指出在冬天時會卷成一團窩在爐被中是迷信並加以否定，但在『求聞史紀』中有人看見她在人里中捲成一團的窩在爐被中。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18972"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18972","value":"妖怪（猫又）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18972","value":"使用妖術的能力（式神依凭時），令人惊慌的能力（妖怪猫时）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/7195c81e04b22bbc85ed89bc26b6c8433a87cb3434dcbe58ca7ac454b25d045e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ecbfa51c5a2c31cccd0af3ff4427481b40cf25bc605549d49969932be6d08e63.webp","width":74,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_18973","characterName":"八意 永琳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"18973","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"}]},"originalCharacterName":"八意 永琳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"藥師世家，月之賢者，永琳更是族中的天才。與月之都之王的月夜見一起移居月球的前地球人。有著超乎人類想象的智慧，也是月夜見的商量对象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『永夜抄』異變的真正黑幕。過去作為月之賢者，努力地教導輝夜。正因這個原因，在只有和輝夜兩個人的時候會用同輩的語氣與輝夜交談，但在如果有外人在會使用敬語，稱輝夜為公主殿下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"從前利用輝夜的能力來製造了蓬萊之藥，把藥喝下的輝夜最後被逐出月球，而自己卻沒有被放逐。對於不能阻止輝夜的事而感到懊悔，於是決定一生守護著輝夜，並作為輝夜的隨從而生活。永琳本身也對在幻想鄉生活一事有興趣似的。於『儚月抄』中，她也曾經是身為其他月之使者的負責人的綿月姊妹的教導人，直到現在綿月姊妹仍很仰慕她，與為地球人稱為「嫦娥」的人物製作了蓬萊之藥。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外永琳的名字是假名，真正的名字地球人是無法發音的。鈴仙·優曇華院·稲葉稱她為師父。『永夜抄』異變後便一直從事藥師和醫生。『文花帖（書籍）』中向文和「魔法之森的人偶師」（目前為止登場的人物中，只有愛莉絲的條件能和該稱號相稱）販賣了「蝴蝶夢丸」（能做好夢的藥），但根據『三月精』的記述，她也有向普通的人類分配此藥。若根據『幻想鄉起緣（求聞史紀）』的話，實際上去人間之里分配藥的是永遠亭的兔們，她是專負奇難雜症的應診。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根據霖之助聽到的傳聞，她用的是蠻高度的技術（『香霖堂』22話的描述，能想像是用X光、麻醉和移植等技術）。可是，在『文花帖（書籍）』永琳說得她好像是知道霖之助的事情，但『香霖堂』22話的描述中，霖之助好像只知道附近有一個「在竹林的一位技術出眾的醫生」存在。在『永夜抄』的冥界組（幽幽子、妖夢組）的結局與『花映塚』的梅蒂欣結局中，尋訪冥界和鈴蘭花田等，有不錯的行動力，而且有著不依賴別人凡事親力親為的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根據『永夜抄』附屬的角色介紹.txt（キャラ紹介.txt），看到十六夜咲夜後非常驚訝，但其理由只有永琳本人才知道。但在遊戲中面對紅魔組（蕾米莉亞、十六夜咲夜組）時卻看不出有任何特別反感的情況，而且咲夜本身也在看到永琳時說「妳是誰？」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"另外，作為與「八意」有關連的事，是長野縣戶隱村中的戶隱神社的中社內，有著名為「天八意思兼命」的神受供奉著。這個神是作為把天照大神閉居的天岩戶挪開的手段而設的神。永琳的Spell Card中也有著一道名為「八意思兼神裝置（オモイカネディバイス）」10的東西。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"能力實際上要比輝夜來的壓倒性的強，但總是壓抑在輝夜之下。除了製作藥的能力之外，還有用虛假的滿月來取代真正的滿月(秘術「天文密葬法」)，或是改變月球的自轉公轉的秘術，真正的實力仍是未知數。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"18973"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9d46dc551cb15618462d2ef73d2d13c6369aad78e8b6d8ad7d8db522f825297.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a5233d82c5b9d8c155df6b6ed77a23522f3e342c949347898a2368a001a0e68.webp","width":186,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_21010","characterName":"因幡帝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"21010","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"因幡帝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"迷途竹林深处的永远亭中有许多妖怪兔，这些兔子的领袖就是帝。帝能变成人形，通人话，并且因为没有烦恼，所以活了很久。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"帝在原作中被塑造成一个爱撒谎，喜欢捉弄人的人畜无害的妖怪，和妖精类似。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"21010","value":"让人类幸运程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5a13288e7b160675460b2e12b5a88d6f884c2bb24be76583cf90a8f63d8c14d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/93/93534cdbb0baaafdf978e2659ea4ef7342117a2e7ced24578531de3ad3b53ae9.webp","width":222,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29616","characterName":"ながえ いく","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29616","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"29616","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ながえ いく","characterNameSource":null,"role":"客串","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29616","value":"妖怪（龙宫使者）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29616","value":"解读周遭程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75dd59d7e0bd1fcd90aa690ec9f6dc3060a2ccbc451f76589a481e273879e288.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6d/6dda6f34c78cb2a7eb975d4722d6f1c0c6b5347fe6d6460964e3220da1c1e987.webp","width":256,"height":248,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_29618","characterName":"Letty Whiterock","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"29618","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Letty Whiterock","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29618","value":"妖怪（雪女）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"29618","value":"操纵寒气程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b5/b5de3993545f04b8db959571a12615c5d5aa1b6a4318c94ae59c4662d507429e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f61caffa6f3aa896b71f17b93e2acf6a1503449e0b50b6adec23a259e77d043a.webp","width":66,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_30128","characterName":"Wriggle Nightbug","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30128","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"30128","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Wriggle Nightbug","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b766a0ed441ad6b9c0d40e976028eabd18ddf01bb73fe0188ae6e6307e183f2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa8be6704176e6144a46432079bf29e72b41efacef0ea8f0b984c6363a027b61.webp","width":136,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_30129","characterName":"Unzan","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"30129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"30129","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Unzan","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30129","value":"入道"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"30129","value":"能够自由地变换形状和大小的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c9d74af6103813a5e553261fa12660dcfb5e86aed1b236314565825b25a421b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/db/db51d4d820fbca401a28bdc974836fa527488df254f55700e35f523f3de658b5.webp","width":128,"height":174,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_4647","characterName":"Rumia","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"4647","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"4647","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Rumia","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在妖怪之中属于弱者，拥有让其周围无论昼夜都是一片黑暗这能力的，就是露米娅。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"这妖怪产生的黑暗，是让火把都失去作用的魔法之暗，闯入其中的人类的视野会降低得无异于失明。被趁着这种黑暗被袭击的话可能撑不了一时半刻，不过幸好她不会和别的妖怪一同行动。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外表是年幼的少女，赤眼，头发是黄色的并系着一条红色缎带，据说是穿着黑色的衣服目的是为了融入黑暗之中，但是由于通常都处在黑暗之中所以很难确认。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也许是作为黑暗的怪物，通常都会被人害怕，不过在看到她真实姿态的人都因为其年幼少女的外表会有点失望。可能将身形包裹在黑暗之中就是为了隐藏她的外貌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"还有，黑暗的能力只是辅助性的，袭击人类的时候都是凭力量来进行。由于外表只是看起来的样子而已，究竟她有多强仍是疑问，在黑暗中又无法分出胜负。看不到退路的话是令人恐惧的。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"4647"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"4647","value":"妖怪"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"4647","value":"操纵黑暗程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/08daa55a5424d896e7b7a0bb99d8b3db73513390382bfbc36c069b2bb5e69af5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a0/a043cb267d8821f393d535e61832e72419ce8780999cf3883386eb71102e563b.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_485","characterName":"博麗靈夢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"485","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"博麗靈夢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幻想乡境内博丽神社的现有巫女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"博丽神社是专门守护幻想乡不可缺少的大结界的神社。博丽的巫女代代以解决异变为事业。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她是历代巫女中最缺乏危机感的一位，不知是因为修行不足，还是因为已经拥有足够的实力。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"她天生地幸运和敏锐，也退治了不少妖怪。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"主要是在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"作为博丽巫女的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"在空中飞行的程度的能力"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"485","value":"操纵灵气的程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f33007c417ade7c73b7ee78244285c2ff601da86919605a6f56c0570deb01c0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc26d83763ce8144e0a342eaeb5a41bf3e1756ec782d0268170ef9bac39c8489.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_486","characterName":"霧雨魔理沙","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1157"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1160"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"12696"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"131875"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1395"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"329342"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"430567"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"},{"characterId":"486","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"73138"}]},"originalCharacterName":"霧雨魔理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"居住于魔法森林的人类魔法使，常骑着扫把，「霧雨店」的独生女。會使用魔法森林的蘑菇調製火藥，所使用的魔法幾乎只有把東西破壞的效果，而且燃料需要長時間準備，但是其效果非常強力，在Spell Card規則成立下，純粹的破壞力在人類當中屬於最高等級。此外在幻想乡是出了名的小偷，帕邱莉的图书馆、香霖堂，如果不是古明地觉会读心术，甚至连地灵殿都会惨遭毒手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"人类"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"486","value":"使用魔法程度的能力"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e00e4df671f5f80d5733c44e4b69596b901aad88177fc335789c2dd5ea6b2d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3bd6c6ab5c1df20f216ccf8f7e1581841d4fed04fe2cad0f92ce726df7fb8d1.webp","width":237,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_487","characterName":"射命丸 文","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"104009"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"},{"characterId":"487","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"5752"}]},"originalCharacterName":"射命丸 文","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"射命丸文是天狗之中速度很快的鸦天狗。手持相机，在幻想乡各处奔走，记录下各种有趣的事件。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽说是鸦天狗，外表和人类并无太大差别。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"随身带着的道具是团扇、相机和文花帖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"团扇是起风的道具，一扇能刮倒屋子，二扇能刮倒大树，三扇能将旅人的斗篷吹飞。是天狗的武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相机是天狗的另一件武器。能将瞬间景象拍下的必杀武器（×1拍摄速度也十分地惊人。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"拍下的相片会登载在新闻报纸上。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"文花帖是将能成为新闻记事的题材记录起来的天狗的笔记本。里面混杂了各种相片和手写文字（×2天狗的手写体意外地可爱。）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"操纵风的能力，指的是既能瞬间吹起狂风又能瞬间让狂风停止，还能肆意刮起龙卷风，纯粹追求强力的猛烈技能。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"鸦天狗（花映冢、风神录、绯想天）/天狗（地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"},{"label":"能力","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"487","value":"操纵风程度的能力（花映冢、风神录、绯想天、地灵殿、求闻史纪、天空璋）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76964ca8ed3f6929b65c57aee506edb84d82d9d95c36aa5803ddc89f98434a70.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5c/5c30a2767989de1befcc33502cf3697399f51b28cb405e96be8425b397255b10.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_488","characterName":"知识与避世的少女","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1146"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1148"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1150"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1151"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1153"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"1155"},{"characterId":"488","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"2134"}]},"originalCharacterName":"知识与避世的少女","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大概有100岁的魔女，平常待在红魔馆里面的图书馆的知识分子，有气喘的毛病。擅长操纵七曜（火水木金土日月），名言是“凡物都有属性。所谓的属性，跟弱点是一样的东西”。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Patchouli→广藿香（一种香草，因此她有“帕琪”“香草”一类的昵称），Knowledge→知识"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"种族","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"488","value":"魔女、魔法使"},{"label":